---
import Layout from '../layouts/Layout.astro';
const base = import.meta.env.BASE_URL.replace(/\/$/, '');
---

<Layout
  title="Home"
  description="AuthMatrix IAM Masterclass &mdash; learn OAuth 2.0, OpenID Connect, JWT, and enterprise identity through interactive guides and hands-on labs."
  section="Home"
>
  <!-- Hero -->
  <section class="hero">
    <div class="hero-inner">
      <div class="hero-eyebrow">
        <span class="badge badge-lab">Open Source</span>
        <span class="badge badge-beginner">Free</span>
      </div>
      <h1>Identity &amp; Access Management<br />Masterclass</h1>
      <p class="hero-lead">
        A practical, protocol-first guide to modern identity. Learn OAuth 2.0, OpenID Connect,
        JWT, and enterprise identity patterns &mdash; grounded in RFCs, not vendor docs.
      </p>
      <div class="hero-cta">
        <a href={base + '/oauth'} class="btn-primary">Start Learning &rarr;</a>
        <a href={base + '/labs'} class="btn-secondary">Explore Labs</a>
        <a href="https://github.com/sepand/AuthMatrix" target="_blank" rel="noopener" class="btn-ghost">
          GitHub &nearr;
        </a>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

  <!-- Zero Trust Banner -->
  <section class="zt-banner">
    <div class="zt-inner">
      <div class="zt-principle">
        <span class="zt-icon">&#128065;</span>
        <strong>Verify Explicitly</strong>
        <p>Authenticate &amp; authorize every request using all available data points.</p>
      </div>
      <div class="zt-divider"></div>
      <div class="zt-principle">
        <span class="zt-icon">&#128274;</span>
        <strong>Least Privilege</strong>
        <p>Limit access to only what is needed &mdash; scopes, claims, and roles enforced at every layer.</p>
      </div>
      <div class="zt-divider"></div>
      <div class="zt-principle">
        <span class="zt-icon">&#128683;</span>
        <strong>Assume Breach</strong>
        <p>Design systems as if attackers are already inside. Short-lived tokens. Signed assertions.</p>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

  <!-- Quick Reference -->
  <section class="section">
    <div class="section-inner">
      <h2 class="section-title">Key Concepts at a Glance</h2>
      <div class="ref-grid">
        <div class="ref-card">
          <h3>AuthN vs AuthZ</h3>
          <p><strong>Authentication (AuthN)</strong> &mdash; proving <em>who</em> you are. Credentials, MFA, passkeys. Output: a verified identity.</p>
          <p><strong>Authorization (AuthZ)</strong> &mdash; proving <em>what</em> you can do. Scopes, roles, permissions. Output: access granted or denied.</p>
        </div>
        <div class="ref-card">
          <h3>OAuth 2.0 vs OIDC</h3>
          <p><strong>OAuth 2.0</strong> &mdash; a delegated <em>authorization</em> framework (RFC 6749). Tells you <em>what</em> is allowed, not who the user is.</p>
          <p><strong>OpenID Connect</strong> &mdash; identity layer built on OAuth 2.0. Adds the ID Token so you know <em>who</em> authenticated.</p>
        </div>
        <div class="ref-card">
          <h3>Access Token vs ID Token</h3>
          <p><strong>Access Token</strong> &mdash; for the Resource Server (API). Presented on every API call. Short-lived.</p>
          <p><strong>ID Token</strong> &mdash; for the Client app. Proves authentication happened. Validated once at login. Never sent to APIs.</p>
        </div>
        <div class="ref-card">
          <h3>Front Channel vs Back Channel</h3>
          <p><strong>Front Channel</strong> &mdash; browser URL redirects. Visible. Used for authorization requests. Never carry sensitive tokens.</p>
          <p><strong>Back Channel</strong> &mdash; server-to-server HTTPS POST. Secure. Used for token exchange.</p>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

  <!-- Curriculum -->
  <section class="section section-dark">
    <div class="section-inner">
      <h2 class="section-title">Learning Curriculum</h2>
      <p class="section-sub">Four topic modules &mdash; each grounded in primary RFCs and specifications.</p>
      <div class="curriculum-grid">

        <a href={base + '/oauth'} class="topic-card">
          <div class="topic-num">01</div>
          <h3>OAuth 2.0 Fundamentals</h3>
          <p>The delegated authorization framework. Actors, scopes, channels, and why it exists.</p>
          <div class="topic-meta">
            <span class="badge badge-beginner">Beginner</span>
            <span class="topic-time">20 min</span>
          </div>
          <div class="topic-refs">RFC 6749 &middot; RFC 9700</div>
        </a>

        <a href={base + '/flows'} class="topic-card">
          <div class="topic-num">02</div>
          <h3>Grant Types &amp; Flows</h3>
          <p>Authorization Code, PKCE, Client Credentials, Device Auth &mdash; when and why to use each.</p>
          <div class="topic-meta">
            <span class="badge badge-intermediate">Intermediate</span>
            <span class="topic-time">30 min</span>
          </div>
          <div class="topic-refs">RFC 6749 &middot; RFC 7636 &middot; RFC 8628</div>
        </a>

        <a href={base + '/oidc'} class="topic-card">
          <div class="topic-num">03</div>
          <h3>OpenID Connect</h3>
          <p>The identity layer. Why OAuth is not authentication, the ID Token, discovery, and SAML vs OIDC.</p>
          <div class="topic-meta">
            <span class="badge badge-intermediate">Intermediate</span>
            <span class="topic-time">25 min</span>
          </div>
          <div class="topic-refs">OIDC Core 1.0 &middot; oauth.net</div>
        </a>

        <a href={base + '/tokens'} class="topic-card">
          <div class="topic-num">04</div>
          <h3>Tokens, JWT &amp; Claims</h3>
          <p>JWT structure, RS256 vs HS256, JWKS, introspection, revocation, and token lifetime strategy.</p>
          <div class="topic-meta">
            <span class="badge badge-advanced">Advanced</span>
            <span class="topic-time">25 min</span>
          </div>
          <div class="topic-refs">RFC 7519 &middot; RFC 7517 &middot; RFC 7662</div>
        </a>

      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

  <!-- Labs -->
  <section class="section">
    <div class="section-inner">
      <h2 class="section-title">Hands-On Labs</h2>
      <p class="section-sub">Run the AuthMatrix app locally and configure real identity scenarios step by step.</p>
      <div class="labs-grid">

        <a href={base + '/labs/lab-01'} class="lab-card">
          <div class="lab-header">
            <span class="lab-num">Lab 1</span>
            <span class="badge badge-beginner">No IdP needed</span>
          </div>
          <h3>Local RBAC &amp; JWT Fundamentals</h3>
          <p>Run the app locally, log in as four roles, test RBAC enforcement, and inspect JWT tokens.</p>
          <span class="lab-time">&#8987; 30 min</span>
        </a>

        <a href={base + '/labs/lab-02'} class="lab-card">
          <div class="lab-header">
            <span class="lab-num">Lab 2</span>
            <span class="badge badge-intermediate">Okta</span>
          </div>
          <h3>Okta OIDC Authentication</h3>
          <p>Configure Okta as an OIDC provider, implement Auth Code + PKCE, map groups to roles.</p>
          <span class="lab-time">&#8987; 45 min</span>
        </a>

        <a href={base + '/labs/lab-03'} class="lab-card">
          <div class="lab-header">
            <span class="lab-num">Lab 3</span>
            <span class="badge badge-intermediate">Entra ID</span>
          </div>
          <h3>Microsoft Entra ID OIDC</h3>
          <p>Configure Entra ID with App Roles, understand the roles claim vs groups claim difference.</p>
          <span class="lab-time">&#8987; 45 min</span>
        </a>

        <a href={base + '/labs/lab-04'} class="lab-card">
          <div class="lab-header">
            <span class="lab-num">Lab 4</span>
            <span class="badge badge-advanced">Azure APIM</span>
          </div>
          <h3>API Gateway: Dual-IdP JWT Validation</h3>
          <p>Use Azure APIM to validate JWTs from both Okta and Entra and normalize claims.</p>
          <span class="lab-time">&#8987; 90 min</span>
        </a>

        <a href={base + '/labs/lab-05'} class="lab-card">
          <div class="lab-header">
            <span class="lab-num">Lab 5</span>
            <span class="badge badge-beginner">Postman</span>
          </div>
          <h3>API Testing with Postman</h3>
          <p>Test every API endpoint across all four roles using local tokens, Okta, and Entra.</p>
          <span class="lab-time">&#8987; 30 min</span>
        </a>

      </div>
      <div class="labs-cta">
        <a href={base + '/labs'} class="btn-secondary">View All Labs &rarr;</a>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

  <!-- Run locally CTA -->
  <section class="section section-dark">
    <div class="section-inner">
      <h2 class="section-title">Run the Lab Environment</h2>
      <p class="section-sub">Clone the repo and start the local lab in 3 commands:</p>
      <div class="code-block-wrap">
        <pre class="install-code"><code>git clone https://github.com/sepand/AuthMatrix.git
cd AuthMatrix
npm install &amp;&amp; npm run dev</code></pre>
      </div>
      <p class="section-sub">Then open <code>http://localhost:3000</code> &mdash; the full app runs locally with simulated auth.</p>
    </div>
  </section>

</Layout>

<style>
  /* Hero */
  .hero {
    background: radial-gradient(ellipse 70% 60% at 50% -10%, rgba(56,189,248,0.12) 0%, transparent 70%);
    border-bottom: 1px solid var(--border);
    padding: 5rem 1.5rem 4rem;
    text-align: center;
  }
  .hero-inner { max-width: 780px; margin: 0 auto; }
  .hero-eyebrow { display: flex; gap: 0.5rem; justify-content: center; margin-bottom: 1.5rem; }
  .hero h1 {
    font-size: clamp(2rem, 6vw, 3.5rem);
    font-weight: 800;
    color: var(--text);
    line-height: 1.15;
    margin-bottom: 1.25rem;
  }
  .hero-lead { font-size: 1.15rem; color: var(--muted); max-width: 580px; margin: 0 auto 2rem; line-height: 1.7; }
  .hero-cta { display: flex; gap: 0.75rem; justify-content: center; flex-wrap: wrap; }

  .btn-primary {
    background: var(--primary);
    color: #000;
    font-weight: 700;
    text-decoration: none;
    padding: 0.75rem 1.5rem;
    border-radius: var(--radius);
    font-size: 0.95rem;
    transition: opacity 0.15s;
  }
  .btn-primary:hover { opacity: 0.85; }

  .btn-secondary {
    background: var(--surface-2);
    color: var(--text);
    font-weight: 600;
    text-decoration: none;
    padding: 0.75rem 1.5rem;
    border-radius: var(--radius);
    border: 1px solid var(--border);
    font-size: 0.95rem;
    transition: border-color 0.15s;
  }
  .btn-secondary:hover { border-color: var(--primary); }

  .btn-ghost {
    color: var(--muted);
    font-weight: 600;
    text-decoration: none;
    padding: 0.75rem 1.5rem;
    border-radius: var(--radius);
    border: 1px solid var(--border);
    font-size: 0.95rem;
    transition: color 0.15s;
  }
  .btn-ghost:hover { color: var(--text); }

  /* Zero Trust banner */
  .zt-banner {
    border-bottom: 1px solid var(--border);
    background: var(--surface);
    padding: 2rem 1.5rem;
  }
  .zt-inner {
    max-width: 1000px;
    margin: 0 auto;
    display: flex;
    gap: 0;
    align-items: stretch;
  }
  .zt-principle {
    flex: 1;
    padding: 0 2rem;
    text-align: center;
  }
  .zt-icon { font-size: 1.75rem; margin-bottom: 0.5rem; display: block; }
  .zt-principle strong { display: block; color: var(--text); font-size: 0.95rem; margin-bottom: 0.35rem; }
  .zt-principle p { font-size: 0.83rem; color: var(--muted); margin: 0; }
  .zt-divider { width: 1px; background: var(--border); flex-shrink: 0; }

  /* Sections */
  .section { padding: 4rem 1.5rem; }
  .section-dark { background: var(--surface); border-top: 1px solid var(--border); border-bottom: 1px solid var(--border); }
  .section-inner { max-width: 1200px; margin: 0 auto; }
  .section-title { font-size: 1.75rem; font-weight: 800; margin-bottom: 0.75rem; }
  .section-sub { color: var(--muted); margin-bottom: 2rem; font-size: 0.975rem; }

  /* Quick ref */
  .ref-grid { display: grid; grid-template-columns: repeat(auto-fit, minmax(260px, 1fr)); gap: 1rem; }
  .ref-card { background: var(--surface); border: 1px solid var(--border); border-radius: var(--radius); padding: 1.25rem; }
  .ref-card h3 { font-size: 0.95rem; color: var(--primary); margin-bottom: 0.75rem; }
  .ref-card p { font-size: 0.875rem; color: var(--muted); margin-bottom: 0.5rem; }
  .ref-card p:last-child { margin-bottom: 0; }
  .ref-card strong { color: var(--text); }

  /* Curriculum */
  .curriculum-grid { display: grid; grid-template-columns: repeat(auto-fit, minmax(260px, 1fr)); gap: 1rem; }
  .topic-card {
    background: var(--surface-2);
    border: 1px solid var(--border);
    border-radius: var(--radius);
    padding: 1.5rem;
    text-decoration: none;
    color: var(--text);
    display: flex;
    flex-direction: column;
    gap: 0.5rem;
    transition: border-color 0.15s, transform 0.15s;
  }
  .topic-card:hover { border-color: var(--primary); transform: translateY(-2px); }
  .topic-num { font-size: 0.72rem; font-weight: 700; color: var(--primary); letter-spacing: 0.08em; text-transform: uppercase; }
  .topic-card h3 { font-size: 1rem; font-weight: 700; }
  .topic-card p { font-size: 0.875rem; color: var(--muted); flex: 1; }
  .topic-meta { display: flex; align-items: center; gap: 0.75rem; margin-top: 0.25rem; }
  .topic-time { font-size: 0.78rem; color: var(--muted); }
  .topic-refs { font-size: 0.72rem; color: var(--muted); border-top: 1px solid var(--border); padding-top: 0.5rem; }

  /* Labs */
  .labs-grid { display: grid; grid-template-columns: repeat(auto-fit, minmax(280px, 1fr)); gap: 1rem; margin-bottom: 2rem; }
  .lab-card {
    background: var(--surface-2);
    border: 1px solid var(--border);
    border-radius: var(--radius);
    padding: 1.25rem;
    text-decoration: none;
    color: var(--text);
    display: flex;
    flex-direction: column;
    gap: 0.5rem;
    transition: border-color 0.15s, transform 0.15s;
  }
  .lab-card:hover { border-color: var(--purple); transform: translateY(-2px); }
  .lab-header { display: flex; align-items: center; gap: 0.5rem; }
  .lab-num { font-size: 0.72rem; font-weight: 700; color: var(--purple); letter-spacing: 0.08em; text-transform: uppercase; }
  .lab-card h3 { font-size: 0.95rem; font-weight: 700; }
  .lab-card p { font-size: 0.85rem; color: var(--muted); flex: 1; }
  .lab-time { font-size: 0.78rem; color: var(--muted); }
  .labs-cta { text-align: center; margin-top: 0.5rem; }

  /* Install code */
  .code-block-wrap { margin: 1.5rem 0; }
  .install-code {
    background: #060b12;
    border: 1px solid var(--border);
    border-radius: var(--radius);
    padding: 1.25rem 1.5rem;
    font-family: var(--mono);
    font-size: 0.875rem;
    color: #94a3b8;
    overflow-x: auto;
    max-width: 560px;
    margin: 0 auto;
  }
  .install-code code { background: none; padding: 0; color: inherit; }
  .section-sub code { color: var(--primary); background: var(--primary-dim); padding: 0.1rem 0.35rem; border-radius: 4px; font-family: var(--mono); font-size: 0.875em; }

  @media (max-width: 640px) {
    .zt-inner { flex-direction: column; }
    .zt-divider { height: 1px; width: 100%; }
  }
</style>
